1 NAME Karl Kristian /Uchermann/
2 GIVN Karl Kristian
2 SURN Uchermann
2 _MARNM Uchermann
2 NICK Carl Uchermann
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 31 JAN 1855
2 PLAC Prestegårdsveien 75
2 ADDR
3 CITY Bøstad, Vestvågøy
3 STAE Nordland
3 CTRY Norway
1 BAPM
2 DATE 28 MAY 1855
