1 NAME Lauritz /Weidemann/
2 GIVN Lauritz
2 SURN Weidemann
2 NICK Lauritz Weidemann
2 NICK Eidsvollsmann
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 27 NOV 1775
2 PLAC Sukkestad
2 ADDR
3 STAE Oppland
3 CTRY Norway
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1 AUG 1856
2 ADDR
3 STAE Oppland
3 CTRY Norway
1 BURI
2 DATE 11 AUG 1856
