1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * ARNT UCHERMANN ASTRUP,
2 CONT
2 CONT født 11. Februar 1864 i Vik, besøgte Lillehammer Latinskole, blev 1883 Student, tog 1883 Lægeexamen og praktiserede derefter som Læge i Ringebu indtil Nytaar 1896, da han nedsatte sig som Privatlæge paa Lillehammer; tillige er han
2 CONC  Læge paa Folkeskolen. 1884—85 gjennemgik han Krigsskolens nederste Afdeling og blev samme Aar værnepligtig Sekondlieutenant. 1896 blev han udnævnt til værnepligtig Premierlieulenant ved Trænkorpsets Landeværn. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Læge Astrup blev 30. December 1895 viet til '''Edle Due''', født 28. August 1871 i Vestre Aker, Datter af Oberstlieutenant Hans Christian Smith Due og Agnes Jacobine Wiel. De har fire Børn. (Trettende Slægtled VI).
2 CONT
2 CONT Slægten Astrup
2 CONT **
2 CONT
2 CONT Arnt Uchermann Astrup was loved by his patients in Lillehammer.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was first doctor in Ringebu before moving to Lillehammer where he maried Edle Due.
2 CONT
2 CONT They lived in what today is called Astrupgården on the corner of the South Park.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was represented in a lot of political commities in Lillehammer.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a very good friend of Anders Sandvig, the founder of Maihaugen Museum. I (Gerhard) was sitting inn his lap the same year he died, 1934) he had lost both his legs.
2 CONT
2 CONT Together with my mother in Astrupården, we found his old telephone from 1899, it had a label on which it was written;"Doktor Arnt Astrup. Kontortid; 10-14, egen hest. He was also the doctor for the soldiers at the camp Jørstadmoen
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT Gerhard Brodtkorb. 11.4.2012.
