1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Merging the Samuel Prom from Moss in Norway to the St. Croix Samuel Prom is based on some conjecture, but it seems fairly likely.
2 CONT
2 CONT Norwegian Samuel's step mom's name was presumably Anna Elisabet Morbach and he seems to have named a daughter Anna Eliza Morbach Prom.
2 CONT
2 CONT His brother is also said in [http://www.genealogi.no/kilder/Juris/n-r.htm] to have worked on St Croix.
