1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =='''Eleonore Lovise Johansdatter Marichs (1733–1795)'''==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Origin:'''
2 CONT Born in Christiania (Oslo), baptized on November 8, 1733, at the Akershus Castle Chapel. She passed away on September 28, 1795, in Melsomvik.
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Father:''' '''Johan Georg Marichs''' (1699–1739), likely of German descent, employed at merchant P. Leuch's wine business in Christiania.
2 CONT * '''Mother:''' '''Dorthea Bertilsdatter Mejer''' (1708–1786).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Marriages and Family:'''
2 CONT Eleonore Lovise was married twice:
2 CONT
2 CONT # '''Ole Jensen''', a baker from Arendal. They had one daughter, Karen Johanne (married Peder Bristrup; descendants include the Pande family in Tønsberg and Fredrikstad).
2 CONT # '''Knud Larsen Mørch''' (1736–1832). Married on November 3, 1758, in Christiania. They had 10 children: Inger Marie (1759), Johan (1760), Maren Bugge (1762), Lars (1764), Ole (1767), [https://www.geni.com/people/Dorothea-Mørch/6
2 CONC 000000002278466504?through=6000000008754305661 '''Dorthea (1769)'''], Eleonore Lovise (1770), Lovise (1773), Karen Marie (1775), and Anders (1778).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT # [https://slekt1.com/familien-morch-fra-melsomvik-og-smaalenene-1923/ Mørch, Gustav. Familien Mørch: Fra Melsomvik og Smaalenene. Kristiania, 1923.]
