1 NOTE {geni:about_me} I was born in the town Lillehammer in 1906 and married my husband Arnt Steen Brodtkorb in 1927.
2 CONT
2 CONT I was educated goldsmith and painted pictures with water color. After becoming housewife, I did not practice any of the two things. That was how the life in thouse days were.
2 CONT
2 CONT After my own wish I got a room in Lillehammer Hospital to die, my pains and illness became too much.
2 CONT
2 CONT I died in 1978 in the age of 73 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT In her baptise she had Marie Dahl, Ruth Offenberg and R Thorvald Lunde
