1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =='''Dorte Bertelsdatter (1708–1786)'''==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Origin and Death:'''
2 CONT Born circa 1708. Died on November 11, 1786, in Melsomvik.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Marriages:'''
2 CONT Dorte was married twice:
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1. Johan Jørgen Marichs''' (1699–1739). Married on January 23, 1731, in Christiania. Johan was likely from Germany and worked as a "vinforlader" (wine steward/manager) for the merchant P. Leuch in Christiania.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''2. Jonas Jonasen'''. They married in 1740. He lived in Larvik in 1741 and Christiania in 1754.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children and Descendants:'''
2 CONT From her first marriage, she had a daughter, [https://www.geni.com/people/Eleonore-Louise-Marichs/6000000008754305661?through=6000000008754321415 '''Eleonore Lovise Marichs'''] (1733–1795), who married master smith '''Knud Larsen 
2 CONC Mørch''' (1736–1832). Their daughter, '''Maren Bugge (Mørch)''' (1762–1859), also known as '''Maren Marie Bugge''', was married first to furrier '''Johan Andreas Zahn''' and second to skipper '''Nils Poulsen'''.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT # [https://slaegtsbibliotek.dk/2023/937697.pdf Bugge, Kjeld. Ulrik-slekten Bugge. Oslo, 1948.] P. 24.
