1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =='''Henrik Sønderdahl (1755 - October 19, 1799)'''==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Biographical Notes:'''
2 CONT Farmer (gaardbruker) in Melsomvik, Stokke municipality, Vestfold, Norway. Died at the age of 44.
2 CONT He likely had Danish origins, judging by the surname and the prevalence of the name in Denmark during that period, but settled in Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Family:'''
2 CONT On February 17, 1785, Henrik married '''Dorthea (Dorothea) Mørch''' (c. 1765 - after 1832).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children from the marriage with Dorthea:'''
2 CONT '''1. Knud Henriksen''' (born 1785).
2 CONT '''2. Johanne Marie Henriksdatter''' (born 1789).
2 CONT '''3. Eleonore Louise Henriksdatter Movig''' (1798–1853).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources:'''
2 CONT * Mørch, Gustav. Familien Mørch: Fra Melsomvik og Smaalenene. Kristiania, 1923.
2 CONT * Dehli, Martin. Fredrikstad bys historie. 2: Fra festningsby til handelssenter: 1767–1860. Fredrikstad, 1964.
