1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Niels_Onstad
2 CONT
2 CONT Niels Onstad (1909 -17 June 1978) was a Norwegian shipowner and art collector.
2 CONT
2 CONT Niels Onstad as born in Kristiania. In 1935, together with his brother Haakon Onstad, he started the shipping company, Niels Onstad Tank Rederi A / S, which later was named Niels Onstads Tankrederi with headquarters in Oslo. Haako
2 CONC n Onstad had entered ship owning in 1932 with the Pan Gothia but because of the uncertain financial times the ship was given Swedish registry under Rederi A/B Pagota. In 1940, Niels Onstad fled to the United States during the Occu
2 CONC pation of Norway by Nazi Germany. Haakon Onstad relocated to Kungsbacka, Sweden where he formed Rederi A/B Kungsoil and Rederi A/B Monacus. 
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1956 Niels Onstad married Sonja Henie. Niels Onstad, whose mother had been a painter, had many contacts in the Norwegian art world, including the Edvard Munch. Together Onstad and Henie established the Henie-Onstad Art Centre a
2 CONC t Høvikodden in Bærum southwest of Oslo.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children :
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Astrid Talley ( born Onstad ) - 1935 -2003 2. Niels Julius Christian Onstad - 1936 - 1981
2 CONT
