1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Christian Ditlef Adolph Arenfeldt''' was born on February 7, 1824 in Kristiansand, Vest-Agder, Norge. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-111477606 Julius Frederik Arenfeldt] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-1114943
2 CONC 39 Petronelle Frederikke Holm]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Christian Ditlef Adolph married [https://www.geni.com/profile-111494931 Othilie Louise Isaachsen] on May 30, 1855 in Oddernes, Vest-Agder, Norge. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * 1856 [https://www.geni.com/profile-111475960 Julius Frederik Arenfeldt];
2 CONT * 1857 [https://www.geni.com/profile-104957840 Hanne Louise Arenfeldt];
2 CONT * 1858 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34661861768 Christian Detlev Adolf Arenfeldt];
2 CONT * 1860 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34661862007 Ingertha Petronelle (Arenfeldt) Omdal];
2 CONT * 1862 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34661861851 Laura Nicoline Arenfeldt]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on February 28, 1909. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ---- Christian Detlev Adolf Arenfeldt[1]
2 CONT
